{"version":1,"content":"<p>方東昇、黃曉瑩及李嘉嘉攜手炮製的《醫生，你有病？</p><p>》，今晚（12日）播出的第6集，個案是腎科醫生蔡堅，這次方東昇團隊除了訪問蔡醫生，還貼身直擊醫生行醫、睇醫生、及醫肚的「三醫」過程。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:56.332780+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:29:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:37:54.449100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:42.170992+00:00","content_hash":"26e179f42f99a4a74a642446e7318363accd94504ec7712467cf2139a94afca8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}